WEBVTT

00:17:31.484 --> 00:17:32.984
Which would you choose?

00:17:35.523 --> 00:17:37.209
Which do you choose?

00:17:38.837 --> 00:17:40.137
And when?

00:17:42.777 --> 00:17:44.976
I believe that the more time we spend

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.977
choosing to run the deep
inner-peace circuitry

00:17:48.001 --> 00:17:50.221
of our right hemispheres,

00:17:50.245 --> 00:17:53.551
the more peace we will project
into the world,

00:17:53.575 --> 00:17:56.107
and the more peaceful our planet will be.

00:17:57.198 --> 00:18:00.265
And I thought that was an idea
worth spreading.